"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is no complete award itinerary among the selected results, so I can’t recommend a bookable award journey from them. The useful next check is the January 2 United lead if that date works for you: it reports 55,000 United miles in economy and a lower source-quoted tax amount than the January 1 lead. The tradeoff is that both results show dates only, not flight schedules, and neither confirms award support for your one traveler.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A5@2027-01-02/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 2 — United award lead\",\"v\":\"This SFO–BKK economy award summary reports 55,000 United miles and USD 24.50 in award taxes; both quote scopes are unknown, so USD 24.50 is not established as a per-person or trip total. It reports 9 seats, but no returned traveler count or confirmation that the award supports your requested party of one. Carriers listed are BR, ET, SQ, UA, and ZH. The schedule is date-only, and the cabin reported does not establish the cabin of every leg.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 1 — United award lead\",\"v\":\"This SFO–BKK economy award summary reports 60,500 United miles and USD 28.20 in award taxes, also with unknown quote scope. Compared with the January 2 lead, it is 5,500 more United miles and USD 3.70 more in raw quoted taxes; the different dates and unknown scopes mean this is not a like-for-like total-cost comparison. It also reports 9 seats without confirming award support for your one traveler. Carriers listed are CA, UA, and ZH; the schedule is date-only, and individual leg cabins are not established.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — January 1\",\"v\":\"The selected cash option is a one-stop Cathay Pacific itinerary via HKG, departing SFO January 1 at 10:55 p.m. local and arriving in BKK January 4 at 10:35 a.m. local; elapsed time is 44 hours 40 minutes. Its USD 640.00 cash quote has unknown scope, so it is not established as a per-person or trip total. It is a cash comparison, not an award alternative.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Search scope and availability: the source reports 378 selected lead results and no selected complete award journeys, but the search provider was partial, with detail and related-result coverage limits. These selected examples do not establish that no other award is available. Confirm current availability and prices with the booking provider.\"}]}"
